<programme start="20261123090000 +0000" stop="20261123120000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Stanford at California</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Stanford Cardinal (5-5, 3-4 ACC) visit the California Golden Bears (3-7, 2-5) in Berkeley. Stanford beat Virginia Tech 40-22 behind Micah Ford&apos;s three touchdowns, while California seeks to snap a four-game skid after falling 36-7 to Virginia.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123120000 +0000" stop="20261123150000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">NC State at Florida State</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Florida State Seminoles (5-5, 3-4 ACC) host the NC State Wolfpack (4-6, 2-5) in Tallahassee. NC State seeks to snap a two-game skid after falling 34-31 to Syracuse, while Florida State seeks to win three straight after beating Pittsburgh 16-10.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123150000 +0000" stop="20261123180000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Wake Forest at Georgia Tech</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Georgia Tech Yellow Jackets (3-7, 2-5 ACC) host the No. 11 Wake Forest Demon Deacons (9-1, 6-1) in Atlanta. With only one loss this season, Wake Forest enters after beating SMU 49-7, while Georgia Tech beat Clemson 20-6 behind Alberto Mendoza.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123180000 +0000" stop="20261123210000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Virginia Tech at Miami</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 7 Miami Hurricanes (9-1) host the Virginia Tech Hokies (6-4) for an NCAA football game at Hard Rock Stadium. Virginia Tech aims to break a two-game skid behind Ethan Grunkemeyer, while Miami enters after a 36-25 win against Duke.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123210000 +0000" stop="20261123220000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">ACC Network Football Podcast</title><desc lang="en">This podcast covers all things ACC football. Hosted by first round NFL Draft pick and former Florida State quarterback EJ Manuel and former Georgia Tech running back Roddy Jones.</desc><credits><actor>EJ Manuel</actor><actor>Roddy Jones</actor></credits><category lang="en">News</category><category lang="en">Sports</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p30993883_b_h10_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123220000 +0000" stop="20261123230000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">ACC PM</title><desc lang="en">Tune into ACC Network&apos;s daily news and information show - with the biggest storylines and best guests from across the ACC.</desc><credits><actor>Mark Packer</actor></credits><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">News</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22693878_i_h8_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123230000 +0000" stop="20261124010000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">Women&apos;s College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Wofford at Wake Forest</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Wake Forest Demon Deacons host the Wofford Terriers in an NCAA Division I matchup at LJVM Coliseum. Wofford broke a two-game skid with a 64-63 win against Presbyterian, while Wake Forest aims to break a two-game losing streak behind Mary Carter.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191292_b_v12_bh.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124010000 +0000" stop="20261124030000 +0000" channel="ACCN ESPN"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Monmouth at North Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The North Carolina Tar Heels host the Monmouth Hawks in a non-conference game at Dean E. Smith Center. North Carolina enters this matchup after defeating Marshall 88-72, while Monmouth aims to break a two-game skid after falling to Princeton 75-64.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
