<programme start="20261124011900 +0000" stop="20261124021700 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Two: Prisoner</sub-title><desc lang="es">Tras ser capturado, Red Bill sufre las torturas de Butler, que pretende hacerlo sufrir antes de matarlo. Mientras tanto, McCoy y Kurt siguen buscándolo.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230131</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/157e9c15f4dafae4216dfa22b5a8a6f9095e9872.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124021700 +0000" stop="20261124031400 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Three: Alliances</sub-title><desc lang="es">Red Bill recorre las tierras yermas acompañado por McCoy y Kurt. Mientras tanto, en Greenvale, Eve lucha por la supervivencia de su negocio y Thompson reclama las tierras de Steve de manera más expeditiva.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230207</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/aedf041fa035115b7c71eacf175d51e01c72a5b1.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124031400 +0000" stop="20261124041200 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Four: Genesis</sub-title><desc lang="es">Hace quince años, Red Bill aprende a comportarse como un hombre gracias a Anderson, un veterano de la Guerra Civil estadounidense. El joven McCoy atraviesa el desierto con su hermano, el malvado Bronson, y el hambre los empuja al canibalismo.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230214</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/9e7f6154bd4a0f94d9c83f9263a3440803c6bdd3.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124041200 +0000" stop="20261124051100 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Five: Justice</sub-title><desc lang="es">Red Bill y McCoy entran en las minas, donde aguardan peligros. Eve afronta las consecuencias del asesinato de Nathan. Tal y como Steve profetizó, la lluvia regresa a Greenvale.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230221</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/d15e31a89397d86a27aa38b996721ec3b0bc8152.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124051100 +0000" stop="20261124060700 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Six: To Hell</sub-title><desc lang="es">Eve asesina a Nathan por haber desfigurado a Symone, una de las prostitutas que trabajan para ella. Los hombres de Bronson encuentran a McCoy y Red Bill.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230228</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/6e3c7cc863fef8521f67d703e99ba82b0ab65b2c.JPEG"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124060700 +0000" stop="20261124070400 +0000" channel="AMC en español"><title lang="es">That Dirty Black Bag</title><sub-title lang="es">Chapter Seven: The Plan</sub-title><desc lang="es">Red Bill acepta ayudar a McCoy a deshacerse de los secuaces de Bronson a cambio de averiguar el paradero de Bronson. Steve se reconcilia con Michelle para enfrentarse a Thompson mientras su tierra vuelve a prosperar.</desc><credits><director>Mauro Aragoni</director><actor>Douglas Booth</actor><actor>Dominic Cooper</actor><actor>Niv Sultan</actor><actor>Guido Caprino</actor><actor>Christian Cooke</actor><actor>Rose Williams</actor><actor>Paterson Joseph</actor><actor>Zoe Boyle</actor><actor>Ivan Shaw</actor><actor>Eugene Brave Rock</actor><actor>Daniel Caltagirone</actor><actor>Benjamin Stender</actor><actor>Anna Chancellor</actor><actor>Aidan Gillen</actor><actor>Travis Fimmel</actor></credits><date>20230307</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/b27086fb7b32a13915e619c2eda066920da089e1.JPEG"/></programme>
