<programme start="20261124200000 +0000" stop="20261124220000 +0000" channel="ESPN 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Players Era Sixteen - MUA Bracket: Tennessee vs. Maryland</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 14 Tennessee Volunteers and the Maryland Terrapins face off in the 2026 Players Era 16 Tournament. Maryland aims to extend a two-game win streak behind Pharrel Payne, while Tennessee enters with a perfect 5-0 record behind Terrence Hill Jr.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
