<programme start="20261123110000 +0000" stop="20261123130000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Timeless Tidings of Joy</title><desc lang="es">Ally, inherits Timeless Tidings, a shop her grandmother, Joy, opened in the 1940s to sell her handmade letter-press tidings. The shop was a labor of love, service, and sacrifice throughout the decades for Joy.</desc><credits><actor>Candace Cameron Bure</actor><actor>Paul Greene</actor><actor>Natasha Bure</actor></credits><date>20250101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123130000 +0000" stop="20261123150000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Hot Chocolate Holiday</title><desc lang="es">A coffee shop owner finds herself in competition with the handsome owner of a dessert shop whose hot chocolate tastes just like her grandmother&apos;s secret recipe.</desc><credits><actor>Aubrey Reynolds</actor><actor>Jonny Swenson</actor><actor>Kelsie Elena</actor></credits><date>20200101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p19121654_p_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123150000 +0000" stop="20261123170000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Royally Wrapped for Christmas</title><desc lang="es">Lindsay, the NY director of an international charity organization, is called to the Kingdom of Veronia by the royal family to interview for the job of overseeing the whole operation. During the interview process, she finds true love with the prince.</desc><credits><actor>Jen Lilley</actor><actor>Brendan Fehr</actor><actor>Michael Hanrahan</actor></credits><date>20210101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p20810126_v_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123170000 +0000" stop="20261123190000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">A Second Chance Christmas</title><desc lang="es">Divorced for five years, Anna and James reluctantly agree to meet their daughter&apos;s boyfriend at a rustic cabin. But when an ice storm traps them in the mountains, they&apos;re forced to confront the history they share as old feelings resurface.</desc><credits><actor>Candace Cameron Bure</actor><actor>Jonathan Scarfe</actor></credits><date>20260101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p34183391_v_v12_ab.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123190000 +0000" stop="20261123210000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Christmas Under the Northern Lights</title><desc lang="es">A historian seeks inspiration for her next project in her family&apos;s hometown, which is famous for experiencing the Northern Lights. While there, she bonds with a local tour guide who shows her the town&apos;s Christmas traditions.</desc><credits><actor>Jill Wagner</actor><actor>Jesse Hutch</actor><actor>Lauren Holly</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p28658633_st_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123210000 +0000" stop="20261123230000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Journey to Christmas</title><desc lang="es">A winter storm forces a New York City fashion model to spend the week before Christmas with her chauffeur and his extended family in rural America.</desc><credits><actor>Ash Tsai</actor><actor>Joey Heyworth</actor><actor>McKenna Flory</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25902939_i_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123230000 +0000" stop="20261124010000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Letters This Christmas</title><desc lang="es">When a once-beloved Christmas novelist returns home to Starlight Point to save her career, she&apos;s pulled back into the traditions she shared with her late father - including writing the town pageant.</desc><credits><actor>Ashley Newbrough</actor><actor>Jesse Hutch</actor><actor>Lara Amersey</actor></credits><date>20260101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p34562262_k_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124010000 +0000" stop="20261124030000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">Home Sweet Christmas</title><desc lang="es">Sparks fly between a successful attorney and her childhood friend after they both inherit her late great-uncle&apos;s sprawling patch of sugar maple forest.</desc><credits><actor>Candace Cameron Bure</actor><actor>Cameron Mathison</actor><actor>David Kaye</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p28774044_v_v12_ab.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124030000 +0000" stop="20261124050000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">A Vintage Christmas</title><desc lang="es">A dedicated preservationist battles a developer&apos;s ambitions to tear down a historic Post Office with ties to her family. The choice of old versus new threatens to divide the small town unless there is a solution for the greater good of all concerned.</desc><credits><actor>Christopher Russell</actor><actor>Merritt Patterson</actor><actor>Kate Jenkinson</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p28459420_i_h10_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124050000 +0000" stop="20261124070000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">The Christmas Yes List</title><desc lang="es">A chronic people-pleaser returns home for Christmas, determined to finally say yes to herself. An unexpected romance helps her discover that life&apos;s greatest gifts often come when you stop fearing the answer.</desc><credits><actor>Danica McKellar</actor><actor>Sam Page</actor><actor>Sherri Campbell</actor></credits><date>20260101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Holidays</category><category lang="es">Romance</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p34432708_v_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261124070000 +0000" stop="20261124090000 +0000" channel="GreatAmericanFamily.us"><title lang="es">The Art of Christmas</title><desc lang="es">After her latest gallery exhibition literally goes up in flames, struggling artist Liv James accepts a teaching job at a local elementary school to make ends meet.</desc><credits><actor>Brigitte Kingsley</actor><actor>Joe Towne</actor><actor>Frank Chiesurin</actor></credits><date>20220101</date><category lang="es">Movies</category><category lang="es">Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23569204_st_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
