<programme start="20261125080000 +0000" stop="20261125090000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Lakefront Bargain Hunt: Renovation</title><sub-title lang="en">A Family Spot in the Poconos</sub-title><desc lang="en">A New Jersey family of five looks for a lakefront getaway in Pennsylvania&apos;s Pocono Mountains - they want a property they can put their personal stamp on, but with a limited budget, they need all hands on deck to keep costs down.</desc><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13895831_b_v12_ap.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261125090000 +0000" stop="20261125093000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Salvage Dawgs</title><sub-title lang="en">Grace Family Church</sub-title><desc lang="en">The crew travels to Vinton, Va., in order to salvage a massive piece of stained-glass from the Grace Family Church; Tay and Grayson buy a tandem bicycle; Mike and Tay build a beam lamp.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p9501991_b_v12_ao.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261125093000 +0000" stop="20261125100000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Salvage Dawgs</title><sub-title lang="en">Marion Bowling Alley</sub-title><desc lang="en">The team travels to Marion, Va., to salvage a soon-to-be renovated bowling alley, where the floor turns out to be far heavier than they anticipated; Mike buys an artillery telescope; Tay and Mike build a convertible coffee table.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p9501991_b_v12_ao.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261125100000 +0000" stop="20261125103000 +0000" channel="Magnolia Network 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Salvage Dawgs</title><sub-title lang="en">Texas Tavern Sign</sub-title><desc lang="en">The crew members work at home in Roanoke, Va., where they salvage a sign for the Texas Tavern and learn the history of the restaurant over burgers; the team heads to a warehouse in Philadelphia where they negotiate for bread molds and wine racks.</desc><category lang="en">Reality TV</category><category lang="en">Home</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p9501991_b_v12_ao.jpg"/></programme>
