<programme start="20261123111500 +0000" stop="20261123112500 +0000" channel="NHK World Japan"><title lang="en">MATSURI: The Heartbeat of Japan</title><sub-title lang="en">Hyoge Matsuri: Kagawa-cho</sub-title><desc lang="en">The filmmakers take a look at the history of Hyoge Festival, which originated as a sly way of thanking a local hero, who built reservoirs but was exiled in the 17th century.</desc><category lang="en">Specials</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23930022_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
