<programme start="20261123112800 +0000" stop="20261123114300 +0000" channel="NHK World Japan"><title lang="en">Direct Talk</title><sub-title lang="en">Imbuing Movies With a Distinct Scent</sub-title><desc lang="en">In May 2026, Ashizawa Akiko received the Pierre Angenieux Tribute, an award that honors outstanding cinematographers; she talks about visual style and capturing the subtle nuances of light and shadow.</desc><credits><actor>Rachel Walzer</actor></credits><category lang="en">News</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p12585871_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
