<programme start="20261123110000 +0000" stop="20261123120000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Catastrophe at O&apos;Hare</sub-title><desc lang="en">On 25 May 1979, the number-one engine on American Airlines Flight 191 detaches moments after taking off from Chicago O&apos;Hare International Airport. The aircraft banks to the left and crashes into an open field, killing all 271 people on board.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123120000 +0000" stop="20261123130000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Splash Down</sub-title><desc lang="en">Three last-resort water landings, all handled differently yet each one crucial to improving the outcomes of ditching on open water.</desc><credits><actor>Jonathan Aris</actor><actor>Leon Aureus</actor><actor>Redd Ochoa</actor></credits><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
