<programme start="20261123140000 +0000" stop="20261123150000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Blow Out</sub-title><desc lang="en">A cockpit window on British Airways Flight blows out, partially ejecting and injuring the captain; the co-pilot completes an emergency landing.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261123150000 +0000" stop="20261123160000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Air Disasters</title><sub-title lang="en">Design Flaws</sub-title><desc lang="en">When former race car driver Niki Lauda&apos;s planes nosedives into a Thai jungle, a one-in-a-million failure reveals a weak spot in every Boeing 767; radio silence between pilots and air traffic controllers send investigators hunting for answers.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8811659_b_v12_ag.jpg"/></programme>
